            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"02-an-agent-readable-workspace\">02 \u00b7 An agent-readable workspace</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Compare two fresh coding sessions with and without workspace documentation. Measure recovered behavior, not inferred time saved.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Keep the task, model and fixtures fixed. Inspect evidence before comparing scores.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Runner revision: <code>35f2438de849313d5025960e2e63fe6f66c04178</code>. Opening this notebook displays saved evidence and launches no inference or coding work.</span></span>"
